// ┏━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┓
// ┃  ZMK Corne Configuration                 ┃
// ┣━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┫
// ┃  ajpemok                                 ┃
// ┃  Corne 42 Key Layout                     ┃
// ┗━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━┛

#include <dt-bindings/zmk/behaviors.h>
#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/outputs.h>

// ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║  Configuration Variables Reference                                                                                 ║
// ╠════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
// ║  Global timing constants and logic gates for hold-taps, mod-morphs, and custom macros.                             ║
// ╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
// ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
// ║  Hold-Tap Configuration Guide                                                                                      ║
// ╠════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
// ║  Sourced from: https://zmk.dev/docs/keymaps/behaviors/hold-tap                                                     ║
// ╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
// ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
// │  INTERRUPT FLAVORS (Logic Decision Trees):                                                                         │
// │  - hold-preferred: Triggers hold if tapping-term-ms expires OR another key is pressed. (ZMK Default for &mt)       │
// │  - balanced: Triggers hold if term expires OR another key is pressed AND released. (Best for "Permissive" typing)  │
// │  - tap-preferred: Triggers hold ONLY if term expires. Interrupts (other key presses) do not force a hold.          │
// │  - tap-unless-interrupted: Inverts logic; triggers hold ONLY if interrupted before the term expires.               │
// │                                                                                                                    │
// │  ADVANCED TUNING PARAMETERS:                                                                                       │
// │  - require-prior-idle-ms: If a key is struck within this window of a previous press, it forces a tap. Effectively  │
// │    disables modifiers during active typing bursts to eliminate "accidental shift" misfires.                        │
// │  - hold-trigger-key-positions: Defines "Global Positional Tap". If an interrupting key is NOT in this list, the    │
// │    hold-tap resolves to a tap immediately. Crucial for keeping modifiers hand-isolated on split boards.            │
// │  - hold-trigger-on-release: Delays the evaluation of the trigger position until the second key is released.        │
// │    Allows for modifier stacking (e.g., holding two HRM keys on the same hand to combine them).                     │
// │  - retro-tap: Performs the tap action on release if the term expired but no other key was pressed. Required if     │
// │    you want a key to act as a modifier for mouse clicks but still type its letter when tapped alone.               │
// │  - hold-while-undecided: Sends the hold behavior to the host immediately while waiting for the tap/hold decision.  │
// └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

/ {
    // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
    // ║  Macros                                  ║
    // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

    macros {
        // › custom holdable hyper: ctrl+alt+shift+gui

        hyper_mod: hyper_mod {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            wait-ms = <0>;
            tap-ms = <0>;
            bindings =
                <&macro_press>,
                <&kp LCTRL &kp LALT &kp LSHFT &kp LGUI>,
                <&macro_pause_for_release>,
                <&macro_release>,
                <&kp LCTRL &kp LALT &kp LSHFT &kp LGUI>;
        };

        // › custom holdable meh: ctrl+alt+shift

        meh_mod: meh_mod {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            wait-ms = <0>;
            tap-ms = <0>;
            bindings =
                <&macro_press>,
                <&kp LCTRL &kp LALT &kp LSHFT>,
                <&macro_pause_for_release>,
                <&macro_release>,
                <&kp LCTRL &kp LALT &kp LSHFT>;
        };
    };

    behaviors {
        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  1. Home Row Mods                        ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  hand-blocked modifiers for the          ║
        // ║  primary alpha keys                      ║
        // ║  using <&kp>, <&kp> bindings             ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
        // › balanced, right-hand triggered; standard left HRM

        mt_home_row_mod_left: home_row_mod_left {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_LEFT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <250>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <6 7 8 9 10 11 18 19 20 21 22 23 30 31 32 33 34 35 39 40 41>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        // › balanced, left-hand triggered; standard right HRM

        mt_home_row_mod_right: home_row_mod_right {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HRM_RIGHT";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <250>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-trigger-key-positions = <0 1 2 3 4 5 12 13 14 15 16 17 24 25 26 27 28 29 36 37 38>;
            hold-trigger-on-release;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  2. Layer (Hold) Taps (CLT)              ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  variants for momentary layer shifts     ║
        // ║  using <&mo>, <&kp> bindings             ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
        // › tap-preferred: taps win ties; good for thumb keys where taps dominate and holds are deliberate

        clt_tap_pref: layer_tap_pref {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CLT_TAP_PREF";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
        };

        // › balanced: resolves on interrupt release; good for thumb keys where rolls into layer keys are common

        clt_balanced: layer_tap_balanced {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CLT_BALANCED";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
        };

        // › bal + hwu: layer activates immediately on any key press; best when any key should resolve the hold instantly

        clt_bal_hwu: layer_tap_bal_hwu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CLT_BAL_HWU";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            hold-while-undecided;
        };

        // › bal + hwu + linger: layer fires instantly and stays active until tap key releases too; best when any key should trigger linger behaviour

        clt_bal_hwu_linger: layer_tap_bal_hwu_linger {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CLT_BAL_HWU_LGR";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            hold-while-undecided;
            hold-while-undecided-linger;
        };

        // › tap-preferred + retro: fires tap on timeout with no interrupt; best when any key should allow retro tap fallback

        clt_retro: layer_tap_retro {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CLT_RETRO";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            retro-tap;
        };

        // › bal + hwu + retro: layer fires straight away but sends tap on release if nothing interrupted; best when any key should trigger both instant hold and retro tap fallback

        clt_bal_hwu_retro: layer_tap_bal_hwu_retro {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CLT_BAL_HWU_RTO";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            hold-while-undecided;
            retro-tap;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  3. Hold Taps (CHT)                      ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  variants for custom modifiers           ║
        // ║  using <&kp>, <&kp> bindings             ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
        // › balanced: solid general-purpose modifier; resolves hold when interrupt is pressed and released within tapping-term

        cht_balanced: hold_tap_balanced {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CHT_BALANCED";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
        };

        // › tap-unless-interrupted: hold only fires if another key cuts in before tapping-term; best for keys that should almost always tap

        cht_tui: hold_tap_tui {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CHT_TUI";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "tap-unless-interrupted";
        };

        // › tap-preferred + retro: fires tap on release if nothing interrupted; good for punctuation or symbol keys that rarely need their hold mod

        cht_retro: hold_tap_retro {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CHT_RETRO";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <150>;
            quick-tap-ms = <125>;
            retro-tap;
            flavor = "tap-preferred";
        };

        // › bal + hwu: modifier activates immediately on any key press; best when any key should resolve the hold instantly

        cht_bal_hwu: hold_tap_bal_hwu {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CHT_BAL_HWU";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-while-undecided;
        };

        // › bal + hwu + linger: modifier fires instantly and stays held until tap key lifts; best when any key should trigger linger behaviour

        cht_bal_hwu_linger: hold_tap_bal_hwu_linger {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CHT_BAL_HWU_LGR";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-while-undecided;
            hold-while-undecided-linger;
        };

        // › bal + hwu + retro: modifier fires straight away but sends tap on release if nothing interrupted; best when any key should trigger both instant hold and retro tap fallback

        cht_bal_hwu_retro: hold_tap_bal_hwu_retro {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CHT_BAL_HWU_RTO";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <150>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            hold-while-undecided;
            retro-tap;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  4. Tap-Dances                           ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
        // › single: hyper, double: meh

        td_hyper_meh: dance_hyper_meh {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_HYPER_MEH";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&hyper_mod>, <&meh_mod>;

            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
        };

        // › single: meh, double: hyper

        td_meh_hyper: dance_meh_hyper {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_MEH_HYPER";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&meh_mod>, <&hyper_mod>;

            tapping-term-ms = <175>;
        };

        // › single: caps word, double: caps lock

        td_caps_word: dance_caps_word {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-tap-dance";
            label = "TD_CAPS_WORD";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            bindings = <&caps_word>, <&kp CAPSLOCK>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  5. Mod-Morphs                           ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
        // › default: backspace, shifted: delete

        mm_bspc_del: morph_bspc_del {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_BSPC_DEL";
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>, <&kp DELETE>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // › default: esc, shifted: grave

        mm_esc_grave: morph_esc_grave {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ESC_GRAVE";
            bindings = <&kp ESC>, <&kp GRAVE>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // › default: *, shifted: ~

        mm_asterisk_tilde: morph_asterisk_tilde {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_ASTERISK_TILDE";
            bindings = <&kp ASTERISK>, <&kp TILDE>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // › default: (, shifted: !

        mm_l_parenth_exlclaim: morph_l_parenth_exclaim {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_L_PARENTH_EXCLAIM";
            bindings = <&kp LEFT_PARENTHESIS>, <&kp EXCLAMATION>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // › default: ), shifted: |

        mm_r_parenth_pipe: morph_r_parenth_pipe {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-mod-morph";
            label = "MM_R_PARENTH_PIPE";
            bindings = <&kp RIGHT_PARENTHESIS>, <&kp PIPE>;

            #binding-cells = <0>;
            mods = <(MOD_LSFT|MOD_RSFT)>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  6. Mod-Morph Hold Taps                  ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  hold-tap wrappers with mod-morph taps   ║
        // ║  tap param is unused; pass 0 in keymap   ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝
        // › hold: layer, tap: mod-morphed -> bspc / shifted: del

        clt_mm_bal_bspc_del: layer_tap_morph_bal_bspc_del {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "CLT_MM_BAL_BSPC_DEL";
            bindings = <&mo>, <&mm_bspc_del>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            flavor = "balanced";
            tapping-term-ms = <200>;
            quick-tap-ms = <150>;
        };

        // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
        // ║  7. Custom Sticky Keys                   ║
        // ╠══════════════════════════════════════════╣
        // ║  default release-after-ms is: 1000ms     ║
        // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

        // › defaullt sticky key with custom 5000ms timeout
        csl_5000: custom_sticky_layer {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-sticky-key";
            label = "STICKY_LAYER_5000";
            #binding-cells = <1>;
            bindings = <&mo>;
            release-after-ms = <5000>;
        };

        // › ignore-modifiers variant to be more forgiving for chording layer keys through modifiers
        csl_5000_ignore_mods: custom_sticky_layer_ignore_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-sticky-key";
            label = "STICKY_LAYER_5000";
            #binding-cells = <1>;
            bindings = <&mo>;
            release-after-ms = <5000>;
            ignore-modifiers;
        };
    };

    // ╔══════════════════════════════════════════╗
    // ║  Combos                                  ║
    // ╚══════════════════════════════════════════╝

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        // › jk: backspace on mac and number layers

        combo_jk_backspace {
            bindings = <&kp BACKSPACE>;
            key-positions = <19 20>;
            layers = <0 2>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        mac {
            label = "mac";
            bindings = <
&mm_esc_grave             &kp Q                             &kp W                             &kp E                          &kp R                          &kp T                   &kp Y                           &kp U                                 &kp I                           &kp O                               &kp P                                       &kp MINUS
&kp TAB                   &mt_home_row_mod_left LEFT_GUI A  &mt_home_row_mod_left LEFT_ALT S  &mt_home_row_mod_left LCTRL D  &mt_home_row_mod_left LSHFT F  &kp G                   &kp H                           &mt_home_row_mod_right RIGHT_SHIFT J  &mt_home_row_mod_right RCTRL K  &mt_home_row_mod_right RIGHT_ALT L  &mt_home_row_mod_right RIGHT_GUI SEMICOLON  &kp SQT
&clt_mm_bal_bspc_del 4 0  &kp Z                             &kp X                             &kp C                          &kp V                          &kp B                   &kp N                           &kp M                                 &kp COMMA                       &kp DOT                             &kp SLASH                                   &mm_asterisk_tilde
                                                                                              &td_hyper_meh                  &clt_balanced 3 SPACE          &clt_bal_hwu 2 ENTER    &cht_bal_hwu RIGHT_SHIFT ENTER  &clt_balanced 2 SPACE                 &clt_mm_bal_bspc_del 3 0
            >;
        };

        win {
            label = "win";
            bindings = <
&mm_esc_grave             &kp Q                                 &kp W                             &kp E                             &kp R                          &kp T                   &kp Y                           &kp U                                 &kp I                           &kp O                               &kp P                                       &kp MINUS
&kp TAB                   &mt_home_row_mod_left LEFT_CONTROL A  &mt_home_row_mod_left LEFT_ALT S  &mt_home_row_mod_left LEFT_GUI D  &mt_home_row_mod_left LSHFT F  &kp G                   &kp H                           &mt_home_row_mod_right RIGHT_SHIFT J  &mt_home_row_mod_right RCTRL K  &mt_home_row_mod_right RIGHT_ALT L  &mt_home_row_mod_right RIGHT_GUI SEMICOLON  &kp SQT
&clt_mm_bal_bspc_del 4 0  &kp Z                                 &kp X                             &kp C                             &kp V                          &kp B                   &kp N                           &kp M                                 &kp COMMA                       &kp DOT                             &kp SLASH                                   &mm_asterisk_tilde
                                                                                                  &td_hyper_meh                     &clt_balanced 3 SPACE          &clt_bal_hwu 2 ENTER    &cht_bal_hwu RIGHT_SHIFT ENTER  &clt_balanced 2 SPACE                 &clt_mm_bal_bspc_del 3 0
            >;
        };

        number {
            label = "number";
            bindings = <
&kp GRAVE  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N7  &kp N8  &kp N9                        &kp ASTRK  &kp LBKT                &kp RBKT
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N4  &kp N5  &kp N6                        &kp MINUS  &mm_l_parenth_exlclaim  &mm_r_parenth_pipe
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp N1  &kp N2  &kp N3                        &kp PLUS   &kp FSLH                &kp BSLH
                           &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &kp N0  &cht_balanced RSHFT KP_EQUAL
            >;
        };

        movement {
            label = "movement";
            bindings = <
&kp GRAVE  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp HOME  &kp PAGE_DOWN  &kp PAGE_UP  &kp END    &trans  &trans
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &kp LEFT  &kp DOWN       &kp UP       &kp RIGHT  &trans  &trans
&trans     &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans         &trans       &trans     &trans  &trans
                           &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans    &trans         &trans
            >;
        };

        extra {
            label = "extra";
            bindings = <
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                        &trans  &trans  &trans    &trans  &trans  &trans
            >;
        };

        transition {
            label = "transition";
            bindings = <
&kp F1   &kp F2   &kp F3   &kp F4   &kp F5   &kp F6                       &kp F7   &kp F8   &kp F9   &kp F10  &kp F11  &kp F12
&kp F13  &kp F14  &kp F15  &kp F16  &kp F17  &kp F18                      &kp F19  &kp F20  &kp F21  &kp F22  &kp F23  &kp F24
&trans   &trans   &trans   &trans   &trans   &csl_5000_ignore_mods 6      &trans   &trans   &trans   &trans   &trans   &trans
                                    &trans   &trans   &trans              &trans   &trans   &trans
            >;
        };

        io {
            label = "io";
            bindings = <
&trans  &bt BT_DISC 0  &bt BT_DISC 1  &bt BT_DISC 2  &bt BT_DISC 3  &bt BT_DISC 4    &out OUT_TOG  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &bt BT_CLR
&trans  &bt BT_SEL 0   &bt BT_SEL 1   &bt BT_SEL 2   &bt BT_SEL 3   &bt BT_SEL 4     &trans        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
&trans  &trans         &trans         &trans         &trans         &trans           &tog 1        &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans  &trans
                                      &trans         &trans         &trans           &trans        &trans  &trans
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers {
        compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers";

        // › number + movement = transition

        transition_layer {
            if-layers = <3 2>;
            then-layer = <5>;
        };
    };
};
